      "body": "**网址：**[free.stockai.trade](https://free.stockai.trade)\n\n无需登录直接用，所有模型均免费使用。可选择的模型以后可能会有所调整，但这个服务会长期提供，并且完全免费。\n\n**当前可选模型：**\nGrok 4 Fast Non-Reasoning\nGrok 4 Fast Reasoning\nDeepSeek V3.1\nGemini 2.5 Flash Lite\nGPT-5 nano\nKimi K2\nMeituan LongCat Flash Chat\nMistral Small 3.2\nOpenAI gpt-oss-20b\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7245335b-7c95-4d68-b536-467a0dc6bdbd)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/05a19205-bf7b-4702-b065-77e9295135ee)\n",
